Mathematical source
-------------------
Quantum minimum description of density matrices, by Patrick Hayden,
Alexander Maloney, Jinzhao Wang, and Yuxiang Yang; manuscript article.tex
as supplied with this project. Bibliographic authorship does not imply that
all manuscript authors reviewed or endorsed the generated Lean code.
The companion Letter, Free entropy and quantum minimum description length,
by the same authors, is included as letter.tex with its compression.pdf figure.
The manuscripts and figure retain their authors' rights; the Lean certificates
cover the Article's stated scope, not all geometric claims of the Letter.

