Prior formalization
-------------------
The existing source comments record these adaptations:
* lean/FreeEntropy/Channels.lean: Kraus/amplification proofs adapted from
  Cloning-github/formalization/Cloning/Channels.lean.
* lean/FreeEntropy/CartanChannel.lean: forward slice/Kraus and partial-trace
  algebra adapted from Cloning/CartanChannel.lean, Cloning/Compression.lean,
  and Cloning/MatrixPartialTraceCovariance.lean in that earlier project.

Those modules are source-level adaptations, not hidden build dependencies.
The prior source repository is JWang226/Cloning, inspected at commit
dca79dc637649a44d41125387e534d0f6b747b84 (private source record).
The four files under formalization/Cloning/ are Channels.lean,
CartanChannel.lean, Compression.lean and MatrixPartialTraceCovariance.lean.
No covering upstream license was found in that source snapshot. On 2026-10-06,
the maintainer expressly confirmed authority to release the adapted code in
this project under Apache-2.0. This confirmed grant covers the adaptations
included here. No additional source from that repository was bundled during
release preparation.

